  "statement": "Evaluate $\\displaystyle\\int_0^1 x e^x\\,dx$ using integration by parts.",
  "solution": "Let $u=x$, $dv=e^x dx$. Then $\\int_0^1 x e^x dx=[xe^x-e^x]_0^1=(e-e)-(0-1)=1$.",
